  "translation": "Whoever recites this hymn, <b>sung by the ten-headed one</b> (Rāvaṇa) and devoted to the worship of Shambhu, at the <b>end of puja in the evening</b> (pradoṣa), to him Shambhu always grants <b>steady, smiling Lakshmi</b>, with chariots, fine elephants and horses.",
